# Default allowlist for the sbx forward proxy (one entry per line, '#' comments).
# Format: host, *.domain (subdomains only, not domain itself), IP, IP:port,
# [IPv6]:port. The proxy (Smokescreen) has no port dimension for names or
# public IPs: host, host:port and public IP:port all grant EVERY port. Only
# IP:port for a private/loopback/link-local IP stays port-scoped.

# --- Claude Code (LLM API + CLI infrastructure) ---
api.anthropic.com
claude.ai
claude.com
platform.claude.com
downloads.claude.ai
code.claude.com
registry.npmjs.org

# --- Dev tooling / package managers ---
deb.debian.org
security.debian.org
pypi.org
files.pythonhosted.org
github.com
api.github.com
codeload.github.com
raw.githubusercontent.com

# --- Host services ---
# The local model server (host.containers.internal:<port>) is NOT listed
# here: the sandbox scripts grant it to the proxy as a trusted upstream,
# derived from the model config's ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL.
